>Take on contracts from the GTF, ranging from resource gathering to fleet building. Every decision impacts your standing with the Federation\u2019s ruthless officials. Success brings rewards; failure has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a Neon-Fused, Retro-Futuristic Aesthetic</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vibrant, synthwave-inspired visuals of <i>Exo Exploits</i>. From glowing factory floors to pulsating space vistas, the retro-futuristic atmosphere makes every moment unforgettable.</p>",
